B.axj=new A.c0("The Pandlish server or the providers above may be located outside Vietnam. When personal data is transferred abroad we prepare a transfer impact assessment under Law 91/2025/QH15 and file it with the competent authority where required. For users in the EU / UK we rely on appropriate safeguards such as the European Commission's Standard Contractual Clauses.")
