B.axl=new A.c0("G\xf3i h\u1ed9i vi\xean (Tu\u1ea7n, Th\xe1ng, N\u0103m \u2014 t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng gia h\u1ea1n) v\xe0 g\xf3i Tre tr\xean iOS / Android \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thanh to\xe1n qua Apple App Store ho\u1eb7c Google Play. Ch\xfang m\xecnh kh\xf4ng bao gi\u1edd nh\u1eadn hay l\u01b0u s\u1ed1 th\u1ebb ho\u1eb7c th\xf4ng tin thanh to\xe1n. Ch\xfang m\xecnh ch\u1ec9 nh\u1eadn m\xe3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, m\xe3 giao d\u1ecbch / bi\xean nh\u1eadn c\u1ee7a c\u1eeda h\xe0ng, tr\u1ea1ng th\xe1i, g\xf3i v\xe0 th\u1eddi h\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ec3 m\xe1y ch\u1ee7 x\xe1c minh v\u1edbi Apple / Google, trao quy\u1ec1n l\u1ee3i, kh\xf4i ph\u1ee5c giao d\u1ecbch mua v\xe0 x\u1eed l\xfd ho\xe0n ti\u1ec1n. B\u1ea1n hu\u1ef7 gia h\u1ea1n trong c\xe0i \u0111\u1eb7t App Store / Google Play. Phi\xean b\u1ea3n web kh\xf4ng c\xf3 giao d\u1ecbch mua.")
