B.ajf=s(["We do not sell, rent, trade or otherwise deal in personal data in any form \u2014 trading personal data is prohibited under Law 91/2025/QH15.","Pandlish contains no analytics or third-party tracking tools. The only advertising SDK is Google AdMob, active only for players without a membership.",'Under the CCPA / CPRA we do not "sell" personal information. Personalised ads through Google AdMob may count as "sharing"; you can opt out by turning off personalised ads / deleting the advertising ID in your device settings, or by using a membership plan (no ads).',"We do not use your data for solely automated decisions with legal or similarly significant effects on you."],t.s)
