B.ahV=s(["Vietnam: processing the personal data of children (under 16) requires the consent of a parent or guardian, and also the child's own consent from age 7. A child's account must therefore be created or approved by a parent / guardian.","United States (COPPA): we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13 without verifiable parental consent.","EU / UK: below the digital age of consent in your country (13\u201316), a parent or guardian must consent.","Parents and guardians can ask to access, correct or delete their child's data and withdraw consent at any time. If we learn we collected a child's data without valid consent, we delete it."],t.s)
