B.axi=new A.c0("The Panda Parrot speaking mode needs microphone access. Your operating system or browser asks you first; you can refuse or revoke the permission at any time in its settings \u2014 every other game keeps working.")
B.aiW=s(["The microphone is on only while you press the speak button and turns off as soon as your turn ends.","Speech is turned into text by your device's built-in speech recognition (Apple Speech on iOS, Google speech services on Android, the browser's Web Speech on the web). Depending on the device and its settings, that service may process the audio on the device or on Apple / Google servers under their own privacy policies.","Pandlish never records audio, never uploads it to the Pandlish server and never stores your voice. The recognised text is used only to score your answer on the device and is then discarded.","English voices come from your device's text-to-speech engine; Pandlish sends no data for this feature."],t.s)
