B.axf=new A.c0("If you have no membership, the iOS / Android apps may show ads served by Google AdMob: a banner at the bottom edge of some screens outside gameplay, an interstitial when you return to the map after finishing a floor, and rewarded ads you choose to watch for Gold, Bamboo energy or one revive. Ads never appear during gameplay. Every membership plan removes all ads; the website has no ads.")
B.a7h=s(["The Google AdMob SDK may collect your IP address, device and app information, ad interactions and \u2014 on Android \u2014 the advertising ID (AAID) to serve, frequency-cap and measure ads and prevent fraud, under Google's Privacy Policy (policies.google.com/privacy).","On iOS, Pandlish does not show the App Tracking Transparency prompt, so the SDK cannot access the IDFA.","In the European Economic Area, the UK, Switzerland and regions with similar rules, Google's consent form (UMP) asks you before any ad is requested; you can decline personalised ads.","You can reset or delete your advertising ID and turn off personalised ads in your device settings (Android: Settings \u2192 Google \u2192 Ads).","Ad content is limited to teen-appropriate material (maximum rating T).","Pandlish never sends your e-mail, name, learning progress or account data to Google AdMob."],t.s)
